span class=css_class style=style aria-hidden="true"
  / The photograph is decorative: the person's name is printed beside every stone on the site,
  / so an alt text here would be the same words read twice.
  - if photo?
    = image_tag photo, class: 'rc-monogram__photo', alt: '', width: size, height: size, loading: 'lazy', **photo_responsive
  - else
    span.rc-monogram__initials= initials
  - if machine?
    span.rc-monogram__flag CI
